# This repo is developed cross-platform; pin LF for source so diffs and hashes stay stable.
# The vendored bundle under contracts/ ships its own stricter .gitattributes and is untouched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
